          "reconstructed": "μ 是有限测度；T>0；η 是渐进 L² 被积过程；τ 是 Chewi 停止时间并逐点满足 τ≤T；B 是相对滤过的实 Brownian 运动；滤过满足通常条件。",
          "relation": "explicit-elaboration",
          "evidence": "All substantive hypotheses agree. Lean additionally exposes IsFiniteMeasure mu for typeclass elaboration; the Brownian probability contract mathematically implies this instance, so it is redundant and excludes no valid model."
