        "evidence": "Independent reviewer inspected the source statement, blind reconstruction, current full Lean module, and candidate statement/formula/proof across all seven semantic slots. The proof only compares the stopped-integrand martingale at deterministic times zero and T before the established random-stopping identification; no broader optional-sampling claim or new delta was found.",
        "review_run_sha256": "f0aef42fc512e93830d6f1aa9f8a6b7c791e951b9c13263b9a8b05a57523b530",
