      "repairs": [],
      "reconstruction": {
        "text": "在相同设定下，设 T>0，η 是时间范围 T 内的实值渐进可测 L² 被积过程，B 是相对于 filtration 和有限测度 μ 的实 Brownian 运动，且 filtration 满足通常条件。若 τ:Ω→ℝ≥0 是相对于 filtration 的停止时间并逐点满足 τ≤T，则停止的 Ito 积分具有零均值：∫Ω(∫₀^{τ(ω)}η_s dB_s)dμ(ω)=0。",
        "text_sha256": "8dd0819bc7fb45552f7ff86384020bae4ef1a1bca195fdcac2659639fc2c3d55",
        "decoder": "source_blind_lean_statement_decoder",
        "decoder_run_sha256": "0c53f030a7ac1c1955a15a7eb34385334376b58ab80f477696ceda5cdda3f8b4",
        "decoder_packet_sha256": "68ce9425165e85966b0b67dafb767c0bb5657a1c7b641e0edfb362406f38eff3",
        "source_text_visible": false,
        "lean_statement_sha256": "eab0b9be93901133cf145ced244411da95426281c7228b76f0c721f9aff79324",
        "input_artifacts": [
